#: includes/arrays.php servcheck_test.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Nijedan"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Opće postavke"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service Check Name"
msgstr "Naziv provjere usluge"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The name that is displayed for this Service Check, and is included in any Alert notifications."
msgstr "Naziv koji se prikazuje za ovu provjeru usluge i uključuje se u sve obavijesti o upozorenjima."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many attempts"
msgstr "Koliko pokušaja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Cacti attempts to run each test multiple times. The first successful attempt ends the testing and records the success. If none of the attempts are successful, the test is terminated and a failure is recorded. High number causes log test duration."
msgstr "Cacti pokušava pokrenuti svaki test više puta. Prvi uspješan pokušaj završava testiranje i bilježi uspjeh. Ako nijedan pokušaj nije uspješan, test se prekida i bilježi se neuspjeh. Velik broj uzrokuje dugo trajanje testa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable test"
msgstr "Omogući test"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disable this test from being checked."
msgstr "Odznačite ovaj okvir kako biste onemogućili provjeru ovog testa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable run script for this test"
msgstr "Omogući pokretanje skripte za ovaj test"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the global Command Execution function is enabled, you can set here whether the script should be run for this test or not."
msgstr "Ako je omogućena globalna funkcija izvršavanja naredbi, ovdje možete postaviti treba li se skripta pokrenuti za ovaj test ili ne."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "Prikupljač"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller on which the test will run"
msgstr "Poller na kojem će se test pokrenuti"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Type of service"
msgstr "Vrsta usluge"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "What type of service?"
msgstr "Koja vrsta usluge?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "IP Address or DNS name of server"
msgstr "IP adresa ili DNS naziv poslužitelja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "You can specify another port (example.com:5000) otherwise default will be used. For IPv6 numeric address use [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use here name of server (example 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"
msgstr "Možete navesti drugi priključak (example.com:5000), inače će se koristiti zadani. Za brojčanu IPv6 adresu koristite [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. Za DOH (DNS preko HTTPS-a) ovdje upišite naziv poslužitelja (primjer 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Resolve DNS to Address"
msgstr "Razriješi DNS u adresu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enter an IP Address to force DNS name to resolve to. Leaving blank will use DNS Resolution instead."
msgstr "Unesite IP adresu u koju želite prisilno razriješiti DNS naziv. Ako ostavite prazno, umjesto toga koristit će se DNS razrješavanje."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service settings"
msgstr "Postavke usluge"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Select correct credential"
msgstr "Odaberite ispravne vjerodajnice"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP OID"
msgstr "SNMP OID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SNMP OID"
msgstr "Unesite SNMP OID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH command"
msgstr "SSH naredba"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SSH command with full path, result of command will be returned"
msgstr "Unesite SSH naredbu s punom putanjom, vratit će se rezultat naredbe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your own CA and intermediate certs"
msgstr "Vaši vlastiti CA i posrednički certifikati"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP Search"
msgstr "LDAP pretraživanje"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search filter, it could be ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"
msgstr "LDAP filtar pretraživanja, može biti ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS Name for Query"
msgstr "DNS naziv za upit"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS name for querying. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use /resolve?name=example.com or /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. For plaintext DNS A and AAAA records will be returned"
msgstr "DNS naziv za upit. Za DOH (DNS preko HTTPS-a) koristite /resolve?name=example.com ili /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. Za običan tekstualni DNS vratit će se A i AAAA zapisi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Path Part of URL"
msgstr "Dio putanje URL-a"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For web service insert at least \"/\" or something like \"/any/path/\"."
msgstr "Za web uslugu unesite barem \"/\" ili nešto poput \"/any/path/\"."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requires Authentication"
msgstr "Zahtijeva autentifikaciju"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box if the site will normally return a 401 Error as it requires a username and password."
msgstr "Označite ovaj okvir ako web mjesto obično vraća pogrešku 401 jer zahtijeva korisničko ime i lozinku."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Proxy poslužitelj"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If this connection text requires a proxy, select it here.  Otherwise choose 'None'."
msgstr "Ako ovaj test veze zahtijeva proxy, odaberite ga ovdje.  Inače odaberite 'Ništa'."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check Certificate"
msgstr "Provjeri certifikat"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to validate the certificate. Default on, turn off if you the site uses a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "Ako koristite SSL, označite ovaj okvir ako želite provjeriti valjanost certifikata. Zadano uključeno, isključite ako web mjesto koristi samopotpisani certifikat."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check and notify Certificate expiration"
msgstr "Provjeri i obavijesti o isteku certifikata"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to check the certificate expiration. You can set in settings how many days before expiration notify.."
msgstr "Ako koristite SSL, označite ovaj okvir ako želite provjeravati istek certifikata. U postavkama možete podesiti koliko dana prije isteka poslati obavijest.."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parametri"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How Often to Test"
msgstr "Koliko često testirati"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Test every xth poller run"
msgstr "Testiraj svako x-to pokretanje pollera"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "Okidač"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the service must be DOWN before an alert email is triggered."
msgstr "Koliko puta usluga mora biti NEDOSTUPNA prije nego što se pokrene e-pošta upozorenja."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Long duration alert"
msgstr "Upozorenje za dugo trajanje"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the test time is greater than this value more times in a row, send a notification. Related to variable Duration count. The test inherits the maximum runtime from the settings. If a higher value is set here, the maximum runtime is this value + 2 seconds."
msgstr "Ako je vrijeme testa veće od ove vrijednosti više puta zaredom, pošalji obavijest. Povezano s varijablom Broj trajanja. Test nasljeđuje maksimalno vrijeme izvođenja iz postavki. Ako je ovdje postavljena veća vrijednost, maksimalno vrijeme izvođenja je ova vrijednost + 2 sekunde."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Number of duration violations in a row"
msgstr "Broj uzastopnih prekoračenja trajanja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the duration trigger must be exceeded in a row for a notification to be sent"
msgstr "Koliko puta zaredom okidač trajanja mora biti prekoračen kako bi se poslala obavijest"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verification Strings"
msgstr "Znakovni nizovi za provjeru"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String"
msgstr "Znakovni niz za pretraživanje u odgovoru"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for in the response for a live and working service."
msgstr "Ovo je znakovni niz koji se pretražuje u odgovoru za aktivnu i ispravnu uslugu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Maintenance"
msgstr "Znakovni niz za pretraživanje u odgovoru - Održavanje"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for on the Maintenance .  The Service Check will check for this string if the above string is not found.  If found, it means that the service is under maintenance."
msgstr "Ovo je znakovni niz koji se pretražuje kod održavanja. Provjera usluge tražit će ovaj znakovni niz ako gornji niz nije pronađen. Ako je pronađen, to znači da je usluga u tijeku održavanja."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Failed"
msgstr "Znakovni niz za pretraživanje u odgovoru - Neuspješno"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for a known failure in the service response.  The Service Check will only alert if this string is found, ignoring any timeout issues and the search strings above."
msgstr "Ovo je znakovni niz za pretraživanje poznatog kvara u odgovoru usluge. Provjera usluge poslat će upozorenje samo ako je ovaj niz pronađen, zanemarujući sve probleme s istekom vremena i gornje nizove za pretraživanje."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notification Settings"
msgstr "Postavke obavijesti"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Email notification"
msgstr "Obavijest e-poštom"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If enabled email notification about state, duration and search result will be send"
