#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "<b>Can be used for a lot of service checks:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - optional, when it is set, try HTTP basic auth<br/><i>SMTP on port 587</i> - optional. Without a username/password, only the server response is tested. With a username and password, login is also performed<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - optional. For anonymous ftp, use username \"anonymous\" and email address as password<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - required<br/><i>MQTT</i> - optional<br/><i>SCP, SSH command</i> - you can use this method or private key method"
msgstr "<b>Može se koristiti za mnoge provjere servisa:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - neobvezno, kada je postavljeno, pokušava se osnovna HTTP provjera autentičnosti<br/><i>SMTP na portu 587</i> - neobvezno. Bez korisničkog imena/lozinke testira se samo odgovor poslužitelja. S korisničkim imenom i lozinkom provodi se i prijava<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - neobvezno. Za anonimni ftp upotrijebite korisničko ime \"anonymous\" i adresu e-pošte kao lozinku<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - obvezno<br/><i>MQTT</i> - neobvezno<br/><i>SCP, SSH naredba</i> - možete koristiti ovu metodu ili metodu privatnog ključa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Basic HTTP auth. Username and password are required"
msgstr "Rest API - Osnovna HTTP provjera autentičnosti. Korisničko ime i lozinka su obvezni"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - API key auth<br/>Auth is sent in HTTP header, custom header or POST method. Credentials in URL are not supported.<br/>Insert API key name and value. Both values are required. For HTTP header the name <i>Bearer or apikey or \"\"</i> is usually used (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). For custom header <i>X-API-Key</i> is usually used (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). For POST <i>api_key</i> is usually used."
msgstr "Rest API - Provjera autentičnosti API ključem<br/>Provjera autentičnosti šalje se u HTTP zaglavlju, prilagođenom zaglavlju ili POST metodom. Vjerodajnice u URL-u nisu podržane.<br/>Unesite naziv i vrijednost API ključa. Obje su vrijednosti obvezne. Za HTTP zaglavlje obično se koristi naziv <i>Bearer ili apikey ili \"\"</i> (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). Za prilagođeno zaglavlje obično se koristi <i>X-API-Key</i> (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). Za POST se obično koristi <i>api_key</i>."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - OAuth2/Bearer token auth<br/>You can have key/token from server and insert it here or use auth flow with credentials. Username and password are sent Json encoded."
msgstr "Rest API - Provjera autentičnosti OAuth2/Bearer tokenom<br/>Možete imati ključ/token s poslužitelja i unijeti ga ovdje ili upotrijebiti tijek provjere autentičnosti s vjerodajnicama. Korisničko ime i lozinka šalju se kodirani kao JSON."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Cookie based auth - both values are required. After login, cookie is returned"
msgstr "Rest API - Provjera autentičnosti temeljena na kolačićima - obje su vrijednosti obvezne. Nakon prijave vraća se kolačić"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v1 or v2 - required, insert community name here"
msgstr "SNMP v1 ili v2 - obvezno, ovdje unesite naziv zajednice"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v3 - The security level determines which parameters are required"
msgstr "SNMP v3 - Razina sigurnosti određuje koji su parametri obvezni"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH private key - Can be used for SCP or SSH command test. These test can use username/password too"
msgstr "SSH privatni ključ - Može se koristiti za test SCP ili SSH naredbe. Ovi testovi mogu koristiti i korisničko ime/lozinku"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the web server is responding. If username/password credential is used, it will try Basic HTTP auth."
msgstr "Provjerava samo odgovara li web-poslužitelj. Ako se koristi vjerodajnica korisničko ime/lozinka, pokušat će se osnovna HTTP provjera autentičnosti."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as HTTP plaintext but adds the ability to test certificates."
msgstr "Isto kao nešifrirani HTTP, ali dodaje mogućnost testiranja certifikata."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the SMTP server is responding. No authentication. You will see server login banner and ehlo response."
msgstr "Provjerava samo odgovara li SMTP poslužitelj. Bez provjere autentičnosti. Vidjet ćete natpis prijave poslužitelja i ehlo odgovor."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted + STARTTLS. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. Without username and password, you will see server login banner and ehlo response. With credential, login will be performed"
msgstr "Nešifrirano + STARTTLS. Također je moguće testirati valjanost certifikata. Bez korisničkog imena i lozinke vidjet ćete natpis prijave poslužitelja i ehlo odgovor. S vjerodajnicom će se izvršiti prijava"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted connection on default port 465. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. With username and password AUTH LOGIN will be tested."
msgstr "Šifrirana veza na zadanom portu 465. Također je moguće testirati valjanost certifikata. S korisničkim imenom i lozinkom testirat će se AUTH LOGIN."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted IMAP connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages. You can use AUTHENTICATE PLAIN or AUTHENTICATE LOGIN method."
msgstr "Nešifrirana IMAP veza. Bez vjerodajnice testirat će se samo veza. Vidjet ćete samo natpis prijave. S vjerodajnicom će se testirati prijava i pokušati pročitati popis poruka. Možete koristiti metodu AUTHENTICATE PLAIN ili AUTHENTICATE LOGIN."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted IMAP but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Isto kao nešifrirani IMAP, ali se nakon prijave koristi STARTTLS. Također je moguće testirati valjanost certifikata nakon STARTTLS-a."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted IMAP, you can try login and test certificate and user login"
msgstr "Šifrirani IMAP, možete pokušati prijavu te testirati certifikat i korisničku prijavu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted POP3 connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages"
msgstr "Nešifrirana POP3 veza. Bez vjerodajnice testirat će se samo veza. Vidjet ćete samo natpis prijave. S vjerodajnicom će se testirati prijava i pokušati pročitati popis poruka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted POP3 but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Isto kao nešifrirani POP3, ali se nakon prijave koristi STARTTLS. Također je moguće testirati valjanost certifikata nakon STARTTLS-a."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted POP3, you can try login and test certificate and user login."
msgstr "Šifrirani POP3, možete pokušati prijavu te testirati certifikat i korisničku prijavu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to resolve DNS record on specified DNS server"
msgstr "Pokušaj razrješavanja DNS zapisa na navedenom DNS poslužitelju"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try DNS over HTTPS."
msgstr "Pokušaj DNS-a putem HTTPS-a."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform unencrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Svi su parametri obvezni. Izvrši nešifriranu LDAP prijavu i pretragu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform encrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Svi su parametri obvezni. Izvrši šifriranu LDAP prijavu i pretragu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted FTP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt). For anonymous connection use login *anonymous* and email address as password. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Nešifrirana FTP veza, prijava i pokušaj preuzimanja datoteke navedene u putanji (/path/to/file.txt). Za anonimnu vezu upotrijebite prijavu *anonymous* i adresu e-pošte kao lozinku. Vraća se sadržaj datoteke."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt) from TFTP server. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Pokušaj preuzimanja datoteke navedene u putanji (/path/to/file.txt) s TFTP poslužitelja. Vraća se sadržaj datoteke."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted SCP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt)."
msgstr "Šifrirana SCP veza, prijava i pokušaj preuzimanja datoteke navedene u putanji (/path/to/file.txt)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SMB protocol, username and password are required. Try to login and download file."
msgstr "Isprobajte SMB protokol, potrebni su korisničko ime i lozinka. Pokušajte se prijaviti i preuzeti datoteku."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connect to MQTT server and listen for any message. You can specify topic in Path (bedroom/temp), blank for any topic. For this test is recommended increase \"Long duration alert\""
msgstr "Povežite se s MQTT poslužiteljem i osluškujte bilo koju poruku. Možete navesti temu u polju Putanja (bedroom/temp) ili ostaviti prazno za bilo koju temu. Za ovaj test preporučuje se povećati \"Upozorenje za dugo trajanje\""

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with basic HTTP auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "REST API test s osnovnom HTTP autentifikacijom. Najprije pripremite vjerodajnicu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with API key auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "REST API test s autentifikacijom putem API ključa. Najprije pripremite vjerodajnicu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with Oauth2. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "REST API test uz Oauth2. Najprije pripremite vjerodajnicu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with cookie auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "REST API test s autentifikacijom putem kolačića. Najprije pripremite vjerodajnicu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP get method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Isprobajte metodu SNMP get. Vraća se izlaz za navedeni OID. Potrebna je vjerodajnica; najprije morate pripremiti SNMP v.1,2 ili v3 vjerodajnicu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP walk method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Isprobajte metodu SNMP walk. Vraća se izlaz za navedeni OID. Potrebna je vjerodajnica; najprije morate pripremiti SNMP v.1,2 ili v3 vjerodajnicu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Use ssh and connect to remote host. After login run specified command and return output. Username and password or private key is possible."
msgstr "Upotrijebite ssh i povežite se s udaljenim računalom. Nakon prijave pokrenite navedenu naredbu i vratite izlaz. Moguće je koristiti korisničko ime i lozinku ili privatni ključ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SFTP protocol on port 22, username and password and path are required. Try to do directory listing of path."
msgstr "SFTP protokol na priključku 22; potrebni su korisničko ime, lozinka i putanja. Pokušajte ispisati sadržaj direktorija navedene putanje."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All fine. Proceed as usual."
msgstr "Sve je u redu. Nastavite kao i obično."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL you passed to libcurl used a protocol that this libcurl does not support. The support might be a compile-time option that you did not use, it can be a misspelled protocol string or just a protocol libcurl has no code for."
msgstr "URL koji ste proslijedili biblioteci libcurl upotrebljava protokol koji ovaj libcurl ne podržava. Podrška bi mogla biti opcija pri prevođenju koju niste upotrijebili, pogrešno napisan niz protokola ili jednostavno protokol za koji libcurl nema kôd."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Early initialization code failed. This is likely to be an internal error or problem, or a resource problem where something fundamental could not get done at init time."
msgstr "Kôd rane inicijalizacije nije uspio. To je vjerojatno unutarnja pogreška ili problem, ili problem s resursima pri kojem se nešto temeljno nije moglo obaviti u vrijeme inicijalizacije."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL was not properly formatted."
msgstr "URL nije bio pravilno oblikovan."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A requested feature, protocol or option was not found built-in in this libcurl due to a build-time decision. This means that a feature or option was not enabled or explicitly disabled when libcurl was built and in order to get it to function you have to get a rebuilt libcurl."
msgstr "Tražena značajka, protokol ili opcija nije pronađena ugrađena u ovaj libcurl zbog odluke prilikom izgradnje. To znači da značajka ili opcija nije bila omogućena ili je bila izričito onemogućena prilikom izgradnje biblioteke libcurl te da biste je osposobili za rad, morate nabaviti ponovno izgrađeni libcurl."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve proxy. The given proxy host could not be resolved."
msgstr "Nije moguće razriješiti proxy poslužitelj. Zadani proxy poslužitelj nije bilo moguće razriješiti."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve host. The given remote host was not resolved."
msgstr "Nije moguće razriješiti računalo. Zadano udaljeno računalo nije razriješeno."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to connect() to host or proxy."
msgstr "Povezivanje putem connect() na računalo ili proxy poslužitelj nije uspjelo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server sent data libcurl could not parse. This error code was known as CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY before 7.51.0."
msgstr "Poslužitelj je poslao podatke koje libcurl nije mogao raščlaniti. Ovaj kôd pogreške bio je poznat kao CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY prije inačice 7.51.0."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "We were denied access to the resource given in the URL. For FTP, this occurs while trying to change to the remote directory."
msgstr "Odbijen nam je pristup resursu navedenom u URL-u. Za FTP se to događa pri pokušaju prelaska u udaljeni direktorij."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "While waiting for the server to connect back when an active FTP session is used, an error code was sent over the control connection or similar."
msgstr "Dok se čekalo da se poslužitelj poveže natrag pri upotrebi aktivne FTP sesije, preko upravljačke veze poslan je kôd pogreške ili slično."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "After having sent the FTP password to the server, libcurl expects a proper reply. This error code indicates that an unexpected code was returned."
msgstr "Nakon slanja FTP lozinke poslužitelju, libcurl očekuje ispravan odgovor. Ovaj kôd pogreške označava da je vraćen neočekivani kôd."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "During an active FTP session while waiting for the server to connect, the CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (or the internal default) timeout expired."
msgstr "Tijekom aktivne FTP sesije, dok se čekalo da se poslužitelj poveže, isteklo je vremensko ograničenje CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (ili unutarnja zadana vrijednost)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Libcurl failed to get a sensible result back from the server as a response to either a PASV or a EPSV command. The server is flawed."
msgstr "Libcurl nije uspio dobiti smislen rezultat od poslužitelja kao odgovor na naredbu PASV ili EPSV. Poslužitelj je neispravan."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "FTP servers return a 227-line as a response to a PASV command. If libcurl fails to parse that line, this return code is passed back."
msgstr "FTP poslužitelji vraćaju redak 227 kao odgovor na naredbu PASV. Ako libcurl ne uspije raščlaniti taj redak, vraća se ovaj povratni kôd."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal failure to lookup the host used for the new connection."
msgstr "Unutarnja pogreška pri traženju računala koje se upotrebljava za novu vezu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP2 framing layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "Otkriven je problem u sloju uokvirivanja HTTP2. To je donekle općenito i može biti jedan od nekoliko problema; pojedinosti potražite u međuspremniku pogrešaka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Received an error when trying to set the transfer mode to binary or ASCII."
msgstr "Primljena je pogreška pri pokušaju postavljanja načina prijenosa na binarni ili ASCII."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file transfer was shorter or larger than expected. This happens when the server first reports an expected transfer size, and then delivers data that does not match the previously given size."
msgstr "Prijenos datoteke bio je kraći ili veći od očekivanog. To se događa kada poslužitelj najprije prijavi očekivanu veličinu prijenosa, a zatim isporuči podatke koji ne odgovaraju prethodno zadanoj veličini."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This was either a weird reply to a 'RETR' command or a zero byte transfer complete."
msgstr "To je bio ili čudan odgovor na naredbu 'RETR' ili dovršen prijenos od nula bajtova."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Obsolete Error"
msgstr "Zastarjela pogreška"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Not used in modern versions."
msgstr "Ne upotrebljava se u suvremenim inačicama."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When sending custom \"QUOTE\" commands to the remote server, one of the commands returned an error code that was 400 or higher (for FTP) or otherwise indicated unsuccessful completion of the command."
msgstr "Prilikom slanja prilagođenih naredbi \"QUOTE\" udaljenom poslužitelju, jedna od naredbi vratila je kôd pogreške 400 ili viši (za FTP) ili je na drugi način označila neuspješan završetak naredbe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is returned if CURLOPT_FAILONERROR is set true and the HTTP server returns an error code that is >= 400."
msgstr "Ovo se vraća ako je CURLOPT_FAILONERROR postavljen na true, a HTTP poslužitelj vrati kôd pogreške koji je >= 400."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An error occurred when writing received data to a local file, or an error was returned to libcurl from a write callback."
msgstr "Došlo je do pogreške pri pisanju primljenih podataka u lokalnu datoteku ili je povratni poziv za pisanje vratio pogrešku biblioteci libcurl."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed starting the upload. For FTP, the server typically denied the STOR command. The error buffer usually contains the server's explanation for this."
msgstr "Pokretanje prijenosa na poslužitelj nije uspjelo. Za FTP je poslužitelj obično odbio naredbu STOR. Međuspremnik pogrešaka obično sadrži objašnjenje poslužitelja za to."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "There was a problem reading a local file or an error returned by the read callback."
msgstr "Došlo je do problema pri čitanju lokalne datoteke ili je povratni poziv za čitanje vratio pogrešku."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A memory allocation request failed. This is serious badness and things are severely screwed up if this ever occurs."
msgstr "Zahtjev za dodjelu memorije nije uspio. To je ozbiljan kvar i stvari su teško poremećene ako se to ikada dogodi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Operation timeout. The specified time-out period was reached according to the conditions."
msgstr "Istek vremena operacije. Navedeno razdoblje isteka vremena dosegnuto je prema uvjetima."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP PORT command returned error. This mostly happens when you have not specified a good enough address for libcurl to use. See CURLOPT_FTPPORT."
msgstr "Naredba FTP PORT vratila je pogrešku. To se najčešće događa kada niste naveli dovoljno dobru adresu koju libcurl može upotrijebiti. Pogledajte CURLOPT_FTPPORT."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP REST command returned error. This should never happen if the server is sane."
msgstr "Naredba FTP REST vratila je pogrešku. To se nikada ne bi smjelo dogoditi ako poslužitelj ispravno radi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server does not support or accept range requests."
msgstr "Poslužitelj ne podržava ili ne prihvaća zahtjeve za rasponom."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is an odd error that mainly occurs due to internal confusion."
msgstr "Ovo je neobična pogreška koja se uglavnom javlja zbog unutarnje zabune."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem occurred somewhere in the SSL/TLS handshake. You really want the error buffer and read the message there as it pinpoints the problem slightly more. Could be certificates (file formats, paths, permissions), passwords, and others."
msgstr "Došlo je do problema negdje u SSL/TLS rukovanju. Svakako provjerite međuspremnik pogrešaka i pročitajte poruku u njemu jer preciznije ukazuje na problem. Mogu biti certifikati (oblici datoteka, putovi, dopuštenja), lozinke i drugo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The download could not be resumed because the specified offset was out of the file boundary."
msgstr "Preuzimanje se nije moglo nastaviti jer je navedeni pomak izvan granica datoteke."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file given with FILE:// could not be opened. Most likely because the file path does not identify an existing file. Did you check file permissions?"
msgstr "Datoteka navedena s pomoću FILE:// nije se mogla otvoriti. Najvjerojatnije zato što put datoteke ne označava postojeću datoteku. Jeste li provjerili dopuštenja datoteke?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP cannot bind. LDAP bind operation failed."
msgstr "LDAP se ne može povezati. Operacija povezivanja LDAP-a nije uspjela."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search failed."
msgstr "LDAP pretraživanje nije uspjelo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Function not found. A required zlib function was not found."
msgstr "Funkcija nije pronađena. Potrebna funkcija biblioteke zlib nije pronađena."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Aborted by callback. A callback returned \"abort\" to libcurl."
msgstr "Prekinuto povratnim pozivom. Povratni poziv vratio je \"abort\" biblioteci libcurl."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A function was called with a bad parameter."
msgstr "Funkcija je pozvana s neispravnim parametrom."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Interface error. A specified outgoing interface could not be used. Set which interface to use for outgoing connections' source IP address with URLOPT_INTERFACE."
msgstr "Pogreška sučelja. Navedeno odlazno sučelje nije se moglo upotrijebiti. Postavite koje će se sučelje upotrebljavati za izvorišnu IP adresu odlaznih veza s pomoću URLOPT_INTERFACE."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Too many redirects. When following redirects, libcurl hit the maximum amount. Set your limit with CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."
msgstr "Previše preusmjeravanja. Prilikom praćenja preusmjeravanja, libcurl je dosegao najveći dopušteni broj. Postavite svoje ograničenje s pomoću CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed to libcurl is not recognized/known. Refer to the appropriate documentation. This is most likely a problem in the program that uses libcurl. The error buffer might contain more specific information about which exact option it concerns."
msgstr "Mogućnost proslijeđena biblioteci libcurl nije prepoznata/poznata. Pogledajte odgovarajuću dokumentaciju. Ovo je najvjerojatnije problem u programu koji upotrebljava libcurl. Međuspremnik pogrešaka mogao bi sadržavati konkretnije pojedinosti o tome o kojoj se točno mogućnosti radi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed in to a setopt was wrongly formatted. See error message for details about what option."
msgstr "Mogućnost proslijeđena u setopt bila je pogrešno oblikovana. Pogledajte poruku pogreške za pojedinosti o kojoj se mogućnosti radi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Nothing was returned from the server, and under the circumstances, getting nothing is considered an error."
msgstr "Poslužitelj nije vratio ništa, a u danim se okolnostima prazan odgovor smatra pogreškom."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The specified crypto engine was not found."
msgstr "Navedeni kriptografski modul nije pronađen."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed setting the selected SSL crypto engine as default."
msgstr "Postavljanje odabranog SSL kriptografskog modula kao zadanog nije uspjelo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed sending network data."
msgstr "Slanje mrežnih podataka nije uspjelo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failure with receiving network data."
msgstr "Pogreška pri primanju mrežnih podataka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "problem with the local client certificate."
msgstr "problem s lokalnim klijentskim certifikatom."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not use specified cipher."
msgstr "Nije bilo moguće upotrijebiti navedenu šifru."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server's SSL certificate or SSH fingerprint was deemed not OK. This error code has been unified with CURLE_SSL_CACERT since 7.62.0. Its previous value was 51."
msgstr "SSL certifikat ili SSH otisak udaljenog poslužitelja ocijenjen je neispravnim. Ovaj je kod pogreške od inačice 7.62.0 objedinjen s CURLE_SSL_CACERT. Njegova prethodna vrijednost bila je 51."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unrecognized transfer encoding."
msgstr "Nepoznato kodiranje prijenosa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum file size exceeded."
msgstr "Premašena je najveća veličina datoteke."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requested FTP SSL level failed."
msgstr "Zatražena FTP SSL razina nije uspjela."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When doing a send operation curl had to rewind the data to retransmit, but the rewinding operation failed."
msgstr "Prilikom izvođenja operacije slanja curl je morao premotati podatke za ponovno slanje, ali operacija premotavanja nije uspjela."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Initiating the SSL Engine failed."
msgstr "Pokretanje SSL modula nije uspjelo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server denied curl to login (Added in 7.13.1)"
msgstr "Udaljeni poslužitelj odbio je prijavu alata curl (dodano u 7.13.1)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File not found on TFTP server."
msgstr "Datoteka nije pronađena na TFTP poslužitelju."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Permission problem on TFTP server."
msgstr "Problem s dopuštenjima na TFTP poslužitelju."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Out of disk space on the server."
msgstr "Nedovoljno prostora na disku na poslužitelju."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Illegal TFTP operation."
msgstr "Nedopuštena TFTP operacija."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unknown TFTP transfer ID."
msgstr "Nepoznati ID TFTP prijenosa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File already exists and is not overwritten."
msgstr "Datoteka već postoji i nije prebrisana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This error should never be returned by a properly functioning TFTP server."
msgstr "TFTP poslužitelj koji ispravno radi nikada ne bi smio vratiti ovu pogrešku."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Problem with reading the SSL CA cert (path? access rights?)"
msgstr "Problem pri čitanju SSL CA certifikata (put? prava pristupa?)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The resource referenced in the URL does not exist."
msgstr "Resurs naveden u URL-u ne postoji."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An unspecified error occurred during the SSH session."
msgstr "Došlo je do nespecificirane pogreške tijekom SSH sesije."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to shut down the SSL connection."
msgstr "Zatvaranje SSL veze nije uspjelo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Socket is not ready for send/recv wait till it's ready and try again. This return code is only returned from curl_easy_recv and curl_easy_send (Added in 7.18.2)"
msgstr "Utičnica nije spremna za slanje/primanje, pričekajte da bude spremna i pokušajte ponovno. Ovaj se povratni kod vraća samo iz curl_easy_recv i curl_easy_send (dodano u 7.18.2)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to load CRL file (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Učitavanje CRL datoteke nije uspjelo (dodano u 7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Issuer check failed (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Provjera izdavatelja nije uspjela (dodano u 7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP server does not understand the PRET command at all or does not support the given argument. Be careful when using CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, a custom LIST command is sent with the PRET command before PASV as well. (Added in 7.20.0)"
msgstr "FTP poslužitelj uopće ne razumije naredbu PRET ili ne podržava zadani argument. Budite oprezni pri uporabi CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, prilagođena naredba LIST također se šalje s naredbom PRET prije PASV. (Dodano u 7.20.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP CSeq numbers."
msgstr "Neusklađenost RTSP CSeq brojeva."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP Session Identifiers."
msgstr "Neusklađenost identifikatora RTSP sesije."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unable to parse FTP file list (during FTP wildcard downloading)."
msgstr "Nije moguće raščlaniti FTP popis datoteka (tijekom FTP preuzimanja sa zamjenskim znakovima)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Chunk callback reported error."
msgstr "Povratni poziv dijela podataka prijavio je pogrešku."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "(For internal use only, is never returned by libcurl) No connection available, the session is queued. (added in 7.30.0)"
msgstr "(Samo za unutarnju uporabu, libcurl ga nikada ne vraća) Nema dostupne veze, sesija je stavljena u red čekanja. (dodano u 7.30.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to match the pinned key specified with CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY."
msgstr "Nije uspjelo podudaranje prikvačenog ključa navedenog s pomoću CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Status returned failure when asked with CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."
msgstr "Status je vratio neuspjeh pri upitu s pomoću CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stream error in the HTTP/2 framing layer."
msgstr "Pogreška toka u sloju uokvirivanja HTTP/2."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An API function was called from inside a callback."
msgstr "API funkcija pozvana je unutar povratnog poziva."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An authentication function returned an error."
msgstr "Funkcija provjere autentičnosti vratila je pogrešku."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP/3 layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "Otkriven je problem u sloju HTTP/3. Ovo je donekle općenito i može biti jedan od nekoliko problema; pojedinosti potražite u međuspremniku pogrešaka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "QUIC connection error. This error may be caused by an SSL library error. QUIC is the protocol used for HTTP/3 transfers."
msgstr "Pogreška QUIC veze. Ovu pogrešku može uzrokovati pogreška SSL biblioteke. QUIC je protokol koji se upotrebljava za HTTP/3 prijenose."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy handshake error. CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR provides extra details on the specific problem."
msgstr "Pogreška rukovanja s proxyjem. CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR pruža dodatne pojedinosti o određenom problemu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSL Client Certificate required."
msgstr "Potreban je klijentski SSL certifikat."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal call to poll() or select() returned error that is not recoverable."
msgstr "Interni poziv funkcije poll() ili select() vratio je nepopravljivu pogrešku."

