msgstr "Postavke HTTP/HTTPS provjere"

#: setup.php
msgid "User Agent"
msgstr "Korisnički agent"

#: setup.php
msgid "The User-Agent string sent with HTTP/HTTPS and other cURL based service checks. Some sites block old or uncommon browsers, so you can set a current User-Agent here. Leave blank to use the built-in default."
msgstr "Niz User-Agent koji se šalje uz HTTP/HTTPS i druge provjere usluga temeljene na biblioteci cURL. Neka web-mjesta blokiraju stare ili neuobičajene preglednike, pa ovdje možete postaviti aktualni User-Agent. Ostavite prazno za upotrebu ugrađene zadane vrijednosti."
